
<p style="font-size:14px;">
  A week ago you took the DSCSA readiness check and scored
  <strong><%= @assessment.score %>/100</strong> (<%= @assessment.band_label.downcase %>).
  <% if @assessment.gaps.any? %>
    Still <%= @assessment.gaps.size %> <%= @assessment.gaps.size == 1 ? "gap" : "gaps" %> between you and
    the enhanced requirements that take effect when the small-dispenser exemption ends.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <strong>November 27, 2026</strong> isn't a soft deadline -- it's when the exemption most
  small pharmacies have been operating under simply stops applying. Whatever gets built or
  put in place needs to be live before then, not started then.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Pharma Transport is the whole record in one place: live GPS tracking, an immutable
  hash-chained chain-of-custody log, proof-of-delivery signatures, and an audit trail --
  plus a fractional compliance officer retainer if the gap is process and paperwork rather
  than software. Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial; nothing is charged until it ends.
</p>

<% if Time.current <= StripeBilling.founding_offer_cutoff %>
  <p style="font-size:13px; background:#fbf1e4; border:1px solid #ecd3ac; color:#5c4420; padding:10px 14px; border-radius:4px;">
    <strong>Founding customer offer</strong> ends
    <%= StripeBilling.founding_offer_cutoff.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>: 25% off your first six months
    on any monthly plan.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <%= link_to "Start a free trial", new_user_registration_url %> &middot;
  <%= link_to "See your full readiness breakdown", dscsa_assessment_result_url(@assessment.token) %> &middot;
  <%= link_to "Talk to someone first", request_a_call_url(topic: "dscsa_assessment") %>
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px; color:#666; margin-top:28px;">
  You're getting this because you requested a DSCSA readiness score. This is the last
  scheduled follow-up email.
  <%= link_to "Unsubscribe", @unsubscribe_url %> any time.
</p>
